Third-party data and assets
---------------------------
- City data for the live globe (src/lib/ga4/geo/places.json) comes from GeoNames
  (https://www.geonames.org/), via the all-the-cities package, licensed under
  CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
- Country flags (public/flags) come from country-flag-icons, MIT license.
- Browser, operating system and device icons (public/icons/tech) come from the Iconify
  sets "Logos" (CC0 1.0) and "Flat Color Icons" (MIT).
- The Geist and Caveat fonts (Google Fonts, loaded with next/font) are under the SIL Open
  Font License 1.1.

